@startuml
autonumber
hide footbox

title US017 - Create a private Collection Of Publications with a name and a set a genre

actor "User" as User
participant ":System" as System

User -> System : I want to create a new private collection of publications
activate System

System --> User : Provide the collection name
User -> System : Collection name provided

System --> User : Here's the list of genres, select one!
User -> System : Selected genre

System --> User : Private collection of publications created successfully
deactivate System

@enduml

